{"name":"Gentle Touch","hex":"#e3d5b8","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gentle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Tender and amiable; of a considerate or kindly disposition.","Soft and mild rather than hard or severe."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To become gentle.","To ennoble."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gentle"},{"term":"touch","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Primarily physical senses.","To come into (involuntary) contact with; to meet or intersect."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of touching, especially with the hand or finger.","The faculty or sense of perception by physical contact."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/touch"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Gentle Touch","blocks":[{"text":"The Gentle Touch is a British police procedural drama series made by LWT for ITV which began on 11 April 1980 and ran until 24 November 1984. The series is notable for being the first British series to feature a female police officer as its leading character, premiering four months ahead of the similarly themed BBC series Juliet Bravo."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/92/Gentle_Touch_title_screen.jpg/330px-Gentle_Touch_title_screen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Gentle_Touch","wikidata":"Q1801482"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/92/Gentle_Touch_title_screen.jpg/330px-Gentle_Touch_title_screen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/92/Gentle_Touch_title_screen.jpg/330px-Gentle_Touch_title_screen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGentle_Touch_title_screen.jpg"}],"sounds":{"gentle":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wi